{
  "id": "section-saves",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Saves\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1286,1292]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Obstacles and other dangers will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1292,1325]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "also have a L, and you will be asked\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1325,1362]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to “save” vs. that L. This simply\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1362,1396]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "means that you must roll  that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1396,1427]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "number or higher on d6 to avoid\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1427,1459]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the danger. For example, the book\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1459,1493]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may ask you to save vs. L 3 falling\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1493,1529]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "object to avoid being hit by a heavy\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1529,1566]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "beam. In some cases, your save roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1566,1602]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will be modified by skills,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1602,1630]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "equipment or other situational\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1630,1661]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "modifiers.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1661,1672]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Rolling a 1 is always a failure and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1672,1708]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolling a 6 is always a success, no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1708,1744]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "matter what modifiers are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1744,1770]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "involved.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1770,1780]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "There is no list of saves  in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1780,1814]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "book: every situation may have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1814,1845]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "different modifiers. If the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1845,1873]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "description of the Save roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1873,1902]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mentions no modifiers, do not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1902,1932]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-saves:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "apply any modifiers.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[7,1932,1952]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    7
  ]
}
